    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the distant future, as endangered species proliferate, humanity has developed a revolutionary camera. You assume the role of researcher &quot;Tint,&quot; the first subject in an experimental mission to restore endangered species on a remote Pacific island. In this story-driven survival simulation game, you must explore the island, gather wood, eat apples, and collect water in a bottle to stay alive. Your goal is to use the camera to capture images of the island's endangered species and collect data to restore them. But be warned\u2014if you fail to survive, it's game over. Survive to the end, restore all endangered species, and uncover the island's secrets.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the distant future, as endangered species proliferate, humanity has developed a revolutionary camera. You assume the role of researcher &quot;Tint,&quot; the first subject in an experimental mission to restore endangered species on a remote Pacific island. In this story-driven survival simulation game, you must explore the island, gather wood, eat apples, and collect water in a bottle to stay alive. Your goal is to use the camera to capture images of the island's endangered species and collect data to restore them. But be warned\u2014if you fail to survive, it's game over. Survive to the end, restore all endangered species, and uncover the island's secrets.</p>",
    "short_description": "A survival game where players capture and protect endangered species, facing hostile environments while maintaining rare wildlife. Cutting down trees and trash lowers the environment index, while cleaning up raises it. If the index hits zero, players\u2019 health rapidly declines.",
